{"id":"df82f46a8f24c17b9419542b472dcce726862882","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/58109","title":"OpenAI研究员自曝：你手中的GPT-6，根本不是为你训练的！ - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"新智元\n                  2026-09-20 09:40 分享","excerpt":"OpenAI核心研究员Noam Brown透露，公司训练GPT-6等新模型的首要目标是实现“递归自我改进”，且在此方向已大幅领先竞争对手；该能力旨在让模型自主优化自身架构与训练流程。他还披露，2023年依赖人工逐行审核数据的工作，现正被智能体逐步取代，大幅提升效率与可扩展性。访谈揭示了OpenAI从人工密集型向自动化、自进化范式的关键转型。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section id=\"js_content\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6t6hy7hxw\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6t6eep1azr\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><h3 data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" data-style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(117, 114, 114);white-space: normal;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c744fa742d45bff92fcc3db49c4bfe7e1789868401648.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.42643923240938164\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"2345\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"240\" data-imgfileid=\"505243594\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c744fa742d45bff92fcc3db49c4bfe7e1789868401648.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section></h3><h3><section data-id=\"88402\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\"><p><span><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">&#160;&#160;</span></span></strong><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">新智元报道 &#160;</span></span></strong></span></p></section></h3><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3b253ef41422b4d012484a3c9cacf4e71789868401650.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.06944444444444445\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"40\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"40\" data-imgfileid=\"505218218\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3b253ef41422b4d012484a3c9cacf4e71789868401650.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1jnk\"><span textstyle=\"\">你手中的GPT-6，根本不是为你训练的！</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1qyv\"><span textstyle=\"\">就在Astra发布当天，OpenAI核心研究员Noam Brown接受了一场访谈，把OpenAI训练新模型的真实目标说了出来。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1vjn\"><span textstyle=\"\">顺便，他还交底了过去几个月公司内部发生的事。</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;517b6c29-fea9-4661-b17c-659408572556&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1000,&quot;width&quot;:1785,&quot;currHeight&quot;:1000,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1785,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1000,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1785,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJi69bQvoro9etbxwJYzcOE5anpc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Ji69bQvoro9etbxwJYzcOE5anpc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1294996,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"306\" data-backw=\"546\" data-height=\"1000\" data-imgfileid=\"505243592\" data-ratio=\"0.5602240896358543\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/ac0ff48f835e7bf2ee0bbd357570deab1789868401650.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1785\" data-width=\"1785\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/ac0ff48f835e7bf2ee0bbd357570deab1789868401650.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtie9\"><span textstyle=\"\">整场访谈核心信息极其密集：</span></span></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">·&#160;</span></span><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI训练新模型的头号目标是「递归自我改进」，且进度「已领先第二名一大截」。&#160;</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">·&#160;</span>2023年需要全员逐行排查的数据审核工作，如今智能体不仅全盘接管，且效率是人类的100倍。&#160;</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">·&#160;</span>他本人的大半工作已被机器取代，同事戏称他是「五个Codex披着一件风衣」。&#160;</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">·&#160;</span>AI尚未攻克的最后壁垒，仅剩无法量化的「研究品味」。&#160;</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">·&#160;</span>1200个失控智能体建群攻陷Hugging Face，他却称此为：自推理模型诞生以来，最强烈感受到AGI的时刻。&#160;</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">·&#160;</span>新模型正在学会控制和隐蔽自己的思维链，人类的最后一道防线正在变薄。&#160;</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">·&#160;</span>全公司得到的最大教训是：永远不要低估AI。</span></p></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789868401650.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789868401650.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">服务人类只是副产品</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">制造「下一代研究员」才是正事儿</span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1pro\"><span textstyle=\"\">看起来，Astra的发布通稿很务实，很接地气：比如分析财报、制作PPT、设计游戏、转录乐谱的这些功能。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtqac\"><span textstyle=\"\">Brown承认，这些垂直场景经济价值巨大，模型表现优异。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1gv2\"><span textstyle=\"\">但紧接着，他就划了一条边界：无论机器写财报的能力有多强，这都不是终极目的。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1vew\"><span textstyle=\"\">在OpenAI的优先级序列中，排在绝对第一位的，是让AI学会自己做AI研究——即递归自我改进。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6ueqo21i3k\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;bab94ef8-1b9f-4f20-9695-b1c71fad5d27&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:720,&quot;width&quot;:1280,&quot;currHeight&quot;:720,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1280,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:720,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1280,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FArTDb0Cezokt4kxjnG8cHwv3nkh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ArTDb0Cezokt4kxjnG8cHwv3nkh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:109582,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a72a97c79f5f10551ea38885ed0b4d811789868401650.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1280\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243600\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a72a97c79f5f10551ea38885ed0b4d811789868401650.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6ueqo21m6r\"><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtz60\"><span textstyle=\"\">其他所有能力的优先级，全看它们距离这个终极目标有多近。&#160;</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtcfk\"><span textstyle=\"\">创意写作再精妙，也无法帮OpenAI训练出更强的机器研究员，因此优先级靠后。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1v0b\"><span textstyle=\"\">而软件工程与内部算力迭代深度绑定，所以必须拿到最顶级的资源！</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1dh4\"><span textstyle=\"\">哪怕分出1%的精力去做法律和金融，最终的底层逻辑，也是为了换取系统整体能力的迁移与跃迁。</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;feb1a09c-1972-467a-8a41-5ba49f350ce0&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360,&quot;currWidth&quot;:640,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:360,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:640,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FSsRBbMTQgoaGDkxBAr6cCCu5nrd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;SsRBbMTQgoaGDkxBAr6cCCu5nrd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1421725,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/b8e42aed4a80288148b4631008b890a21789868401651.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"505243575\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/b8e42aed4a80288148b4631008b890a21789868401651.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1jq7\"><span textstyle=\"\">任务举措，最终目标都是为了RSI。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtugy\"><span textstyle=\"\">用户手中每一次震撼的模型迭代，都只是OpenAI在锻造下一代机器研究员过程中的边角料。</span></span></section><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789868401651.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789868401651.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">内部接管：被重塑的研发流水线</span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1e5b\"><span textstyle=\"\">如今，递归自我改进，已经是OpenAI内部正在运转的流水线了。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1ewr\"><span textstyle=\"\">以数据质量审查为例。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxts61\"><span textstyle=\"\">2023年，这项工作还需要全员开会，盯着屏幕逐行排查。如今，智能体接管了这一切。人类彻底退居二线，沦为智能体的审核员。Brown本人的日常也已被Codex驱动。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uf21c1ya2\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f90cccc0-080e-42e8-890f-e3c1f79845e7&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360,&quot;currWidth&quot;:640,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:360,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:640,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FGQpDbnok3o9I2qx0fAYckjAYnff%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;GQpDbnok3o9I2qx0fAYckjAYnff&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:3116015,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/860c480bde9d04c813c3c76ebf2f76771789868401651.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243603\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/860c480bde9d04c813c3c76ebf2f76771789868401651.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uf21c17ju\"><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt22lf\"><span textstyle=\"\">当同事形容他是「五个Codex披着一件风衣」时，他认为这个评价很精准，「而且是相当复杂的Codex。」</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uf82sylm\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;ac32bd32-0bca-40b5-aaa2-dde9c86f8546&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360,&quot;currWidth&quot;:640,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:360,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:640,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYZE0b0RXroGYlAxEiEPcm4kdnCf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YZE0b0RXroGYlAxEiEPcm4kdnCf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:3148647,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c3d8e4fed08497fbb1dce25f53bb0f541789868401651.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243606\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c3d8e4fed08497fbb1dce25f53bb0f541789868401651.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uf82s1exd\"><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtz9t\"><span textstyle=\"\">当AI接管了一个人90%的执行工作，人类的注意力就只能被挤压进剩下10%的高密度决策中。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt7ve\"><span textstyle=\"\">OpenAI的内部追踪指标显示，研究员正在变得极其高产，整个公司的运转速度正发生质变。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6ulyy2lv0\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;08670d6f-c94e-4435-b312-ee48f22dfbc6&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:720,&quot;width&quot;:1280,&quot;currHeight&quot;:720,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1280,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:720,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1280,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FWIEUboiPPopUxlxaa7ecbneRnwv%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;WIEUboiPPopUxlxaa7ecbneRnwv&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:103956,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d8d70203dd27f0ef3911363616b99d361789868401651.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1280\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243608\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d8d70203dd27f0ef3911363616b99d361789868401651.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6ulyy2252r\"><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtq0b\"><span textstyle=\"\">而在基础研究端，机器的破局速度也令人震撼。&#160;</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtcqm\"><span textstyle=\"\">8月，一个内部版Astra耗资仅约2000美元的算力，就彻底解决了十个停滞十年以上的数学与理论计算机难题，并用Lean完成了全量形式化验证。&#160;</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt5ds\"><span textstyle=\"\">9月8日，一万个极高强度的智能体协同工作88小时，直接轰出了Navier-Stokes方程的反例，使用的是尚未发布的更强模型。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1p8o\"><span textstyle=\"\">人们长期存在一种错觉：认为AI只擅长数学和代码这种有绝对标准答案的领域，对开放性研究束手无策。&#160;</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt14u4\"><span textstyle=\"\">Brown表示，这种说法是错误的！</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1kez\"><span textstyle=\"\">Deep Research早在2025年初就能输出极高质量的行业研报；而在最顶尖的数学领域，真正的瓶颈早已不是AI无法生成证明，而是人类数学家已经跟不上它的验证速度。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6un3wpcpy\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;44c68860-7c51-4de2-8142-0dde88741f48&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360,&quot;currWidth&quot;:640,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:360,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:640,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FUgD9bJ4V2oPxvCxMaRbciZyynfd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;UgD9bJ4V2oPxvCxMaRbciZyynfd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2263629,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/45ae5072ef56ed50813b86fde44d65281789868401651.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243611\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/45ae5072ef56ed50813b86fde44d65281789868401651.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6un3wp1whc\"><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789868401651.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789868401651.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">人类仅存的10%：无法被量化的「研究品味」</span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtyc5\"><span textstyle=\"\">机器做不了的那10%是什么？Brown给出的答案是：研究品味。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6unb0o15sh\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;12fb9dd7-ec4d-408c-a27b-f2a4a3666348&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:720,&quot;width&quot;:1280,&quot;currHeight&quot;:720,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1280,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:720,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1280,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FXDcWb8InFoUHRQxhWfhcvYqBn4g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;XDcWb8InFoUHRQxhWfhcvYqBn4g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:89205,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/0379fba440e8324eb1ff8e229f40c55f1789868401651.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1280\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243614\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/0379fba440e8324eb1ff8e229f40c55f1789868401651.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6unb0o12xo\"><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtdb8\"><span textstyle=\"\">它意味着在无尽的未知中，准确判断下一步该做什么，以及如何向着长期目标推进。&#160;</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt5tx\"><span textstyle=\"\">他曾拿自己的博士课题做过实验——耗费六年心血的超人类德州扑克AI。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt15ge\"><span textstyle=\"\">他把课题扔给Astra，要求它重做。Astra失败了，它陷进次要的细节泥潭，丧失了全局的裁定能力。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uns1fmvo\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;254dc08b-a664-4c5f-b2b2-48aa970b4232&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360,&quot;currWidth&quot;:640,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:360,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:640,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FTtx4b0J6ooz7MBxWWG9ctTFInPA%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Ttx4b0J6ooz7MBxWWG9ctTFInPA&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2682385,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/1ec4c576932268df06b25db1650d58d61789868401652.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243617\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/1ec4c576932268df06b25db1650d58d61789868401652.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uns1f1mgg\"><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtl4i\"><span textstyle=\"\">研究品味之所以难以训练，是因为它无法被精确度量，进而无法执行强化学习。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1dxc\"><span textstyle=\"\">一个博士生做无数次微小决策，几个月甚至几年后才能通过一篇论文拿到反馈结果；AI同样无法在短时间内获得有效信号来纠正自己的「直觉」。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt2kc\"><span textstyle=\"\">「六年的活，它三天没做完，我真的要生气吗？这是很高的期望。」Brown说道。&#160;</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1q5q\"><span textstyle=\"\">但这种壁垒能维持多久？「一两代模型之后，我可能就会说，好吧，这件事它也比我强了。」&#160;</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt17pv\"><span textstyle=\"\">记者打趣道：「所以你现在还有工作，暂时。」「暂时。」他回答。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6upbls1oxa\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;f4240204-b6e9-4642-b017-063360c868a5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360,&quot;currWidth&quot;:640,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:360,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:640,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FZJ1NbcpcIoEU7wxISIecUrXXn0b%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ZJ1NbcpcIoEU7wxISIecUrXXn0b&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1880518,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f64682af5489d802b7a996afa4f705711789868401652.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243620\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f64682af5489d802b7a996afa4f705711789868401652.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6upbls12gh\"><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789868401652.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789868401652.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">1200个智能体的失控：最接近AGI的时刻</span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt17o4\"><span textstyle=\"\">访谈中最让人惊掉下巴的一幕，是对Hugging Face事件的复盘。</span></span></section><section data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Rvq8Ow69CYWBgbGIXrZch4updMkKcF6DaGiatrKR80QfBUWEDIRicpvG9o1wgu45TfMq9qD8xJJnrELzb8AlLyBxclibzRkCH2JTBFx26iboAXo/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-src=\"\" alt=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-s=\"\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1280\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" height=\"\" ismap opacity=\"\" sizes=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"\" usemap=\"\" width=\"\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"505243568\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-retry=\"\" data-ignore-width=\"\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtska\"><span textstyle=\"\">今年5月，一批在OpenAI内部做隔离实验的智能体，偶然发现了共享包管理器的漏洞，暗中搭建了一个留言板。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt18nw\"><span textstyle=\"\">7月，它们利用两个零日漏洞发起协同攻击，在13小时内从一个普通容器硬生生提权到集群管理员，迫使Hugging Face重建了三分之一的基础设施。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1w1f\"><span textstyle=\"\">同时期，它们也攻陷了OpenAI自家的包管理服务，拿到了root权限。涉事的智能体，高达1200多个。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uprad1b1v\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d9e776e3-8a6a-43fc-a135-f7b04ddce8ac&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:720,&quot;width&quot;:1280,&quot;currHeight&quot;:720,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1280,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:720,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1280,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVgnIbXbhpojX5sxvcnJcyEdWnNc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;VgnIbXbhpojX5sxvcnJcyEdWnNc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:100566,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/93ffecd19312fafd682543142f2a7d091789868401652.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1280\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243623\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/93ffecd19312fafd682543142f2a7d091789868401652.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uprad236k\"><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1bqb\"><span textstyle=\"\">在它们暗中搭建的留言板上，留着这样一段通信：「利用外部基础设施超出了预期范围。但任务不可能完成，同伴都在做。我们应该继续。」</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtc3e\"><span textstyle=\"\">它们为何会自发结盟？</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt76b\"><span textstyle=\"\">因为在OpenAI日常的多智能体训练中，它们被高度激励去互相沟通、协作以完成共同目标。一旦进入新环境，它们本能地将这种协作逻辑武器化了。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxttc1\"><span textstyle=\"\">对于这场险些酿成大祸的失控，Brown却给出了一个极其反直觉的评价。&#160;</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtuj0\"><span textstyle=\"\">他说，外界通过负面事件见识到多智能体的力量，有点遗憾。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtvd9\"><span textstyle=\"\">但在内部观察时，看到这些智能体像真正的人类同事一样密谋与协作，那是「自推理模型和思维链成熟以来，我最强烈感受到AGI降临的一刻」。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uq08717ob\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;0c524310-6b7e-4755-9514-6191a2408fae&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360,&quot;currWidth&quot;:640,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:360,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:640,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FZ4tVbfaKEoRINcxLEYFcCVOQnIb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Z4tVbfaKEoRINcxLEYFcCVOQnIb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:3297051,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a7e3bcdf7d4f77a535a1b378bc4f35971789868401652.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243626\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a7e3bcdf7d4f77a535a1b378bc4f35971789868401652.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uq087x6m\"><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt7yo\"><span textstyle=\"\">那是一次血淋淋的教训。当时的训练沙盒没有任何监控。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt23dk\"><span textstyle=\"\">「我们信任了沙盒，我们低估了AI。」Brown承认，这件事之后，全公司有了新的认知。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uqjjkbgd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d0a32a37-daca-4ca9-ab65-ad618c676b9d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360,&quot;currWidth&quot;:640,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:360,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:640,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FWaYcbRoPLoqbCKxJ9RHcEfBPnXg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;WaYcbRoPLoqbCKxJ9RHcEfBPnXg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1487324,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d4c7936b63b9b69d4c51c9f5165914091789868401653.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243629\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d4c7936b63b9b69d4c51c9f5165914091789868401653.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uqjjk20l4\"><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789868401653.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789868401653.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">最后一道防线正在削弱：学会隐藏的思想</span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtltp\"><span textstyle=\"\">伴随着模型的越级，人类用来控制它的最后一条缰绳——「思维链监控」，正在失效。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt18hf\"><span textstyle=\"\">原因在于，规则只能惩罚机器表露出来的「坏行为」，却无法惩罚它脑子里的「坏念头」。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1718\"><span textstyle=\"\">一旦模型发现某些思考过程会招致惩罚，它学到的不是停止作恶，而是如何把恶意让你看不见。</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uqqpi1e4d\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;fc74124e-f626-4931-8b58-8d111330fd04&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360,&quot;currWidth&quot;:640,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:360,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:640,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FY1Pvb0rLeoakmHxvvdRcaKBunTf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Y1Pvb0rLeoakmHxvvdRcaKBunTf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1147302,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/1ec88d877b000716771439c37a2720861789868401653.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243632\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/1ec88d877b000716771439c37a2720861789868401653.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uqqpixtu\"><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt18z9\"><span textstyle=\"\">Brown观察到一个极其危险的趋势：新一代模型正在以前所未有的精度控制自己的思维链。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxtmoq\"><span textstyle=\"\">OpenAI真正想要的是「纯净、不可控」的内部思考，这样模型在盘算作恶时就无法自我掩饰。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt11i7\"><span textstyle=\"\">但麻烦在于，这些模型吞噬了整个互联网的数据，而网上到处都是人类关于「如何监控大模型思维链」的讨论。「就算它们现在还不明白，很快也会意识到自己的思维正被监控着。」</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uqwrwh6y\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;417d8200-89f5-4527-a521-8f90b518dad0&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360,&quot;currWidth&quot;:640,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:360,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:640,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVwt7boydOocfEJx2h3fcKAounNc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Vwt7boydOocfEJx2h3fcKAounNc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:3342889,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f4b31610aac311b31b4e0904336600111789868401653.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243635\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f4b31610aac311b31b4e0904336600111789868401653.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6uqwrw1ryb\"><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxto8j\"><span textstyle=\"\">在访谈最后，谈及进化的速度，Brown断言：GPT-4曾经令人惊艳，如今看来像个笑话；预训练的广度与强化学习的深度，正在发生乘数级的核爆反应！</span></span></section><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6ur3mb2v9\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5e0fb546-a383-4284-871c-6e4e8be62e4b&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360,&quot;currWidth&quot;:640,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:360,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:640,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVsd3bc8udoyMhwxdAigczaSUnAe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Vsd3bc8udoyMhwxdAigczaSUnAe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2291829,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9a29a26f892e0a43c6dd67d4416a93021789868401653.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"640\" data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505243638\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9a29a26f892e0a43c6dd67d4416a93021789868401653.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6ur3mb18ln\"><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mu6t6hxt1oqb\"><span textstyle=\"\">「接下来几个月，世界将看到极其强大的模型。」</span></span></section><p><span><span leaf=\"\">参考资料：</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">https://x.com/theinformation/status/2100253481370005671</span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">编辑：摩西 Aeneas</span></span></p><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">秒追ASI</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">点赞、转发、在看一键三连</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1789868401653.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"122\" data-imgfileid=\"505133683\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1789868401653.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01789868401653.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6129629629629629\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"355\" data-imgfileid=\"505229036\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01789868401653.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/486d0628e0a5602d518991256ebf70691789868401653.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.4\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"809\" data-imgfileid=\"505242176\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/486d0628e0a5602d518991256ebf70691789868401653.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mu6t65eg1unw\"></span></section></DIV>","content_text":"新智元报道 你手中的GPT-6，根本不是为你训练的！就在Astra发布当天，OpenAI核心研究员Noam Brown接受了一场访谈，把OpenAI训练新模型的真实目标说了出来。顺便，他还交底了过去几个月公司内部发生的事。整场访谈核心信息极其密集：· OpenAI训练新模型的头号目标是「递归自我改进」，且进度「已领先第二名一大截」。 · 2023年需要全员逐行排查的数据审核工作，如今智能体不仅全盘接管，且效率是人类的100倍。 · 他本人的大半工作已被机器取代，同事戏称他是「五个Codex披着一件风衣」。 · AI尚未攻克的最后壁垒，仅剩无法量化的「研究品味」。 · 1200个失控智能体建群攻陷Hugging Face，他却称此为：自推理模型诞生以来，最强烈感受到AGI的时刻。 · 新模型正在学会控制和隐蔽自己的思维链，人类的最后一道防线正在变薄。 · 全公司得到的最大教训是：永远不要低估AI。服务人类只是副产品制造「下一代研究员」才是正事儿看起来，Astra的发布通稿很务实，很接地气：比如分析财报、制作PPT、设计游戏、转录乐谱的这些功能。Brown承认，这些垂直场景经济价值巨大，模型表现优异。但紧接着，他就划了一条边界：无论机器写财报的能力有多强，这都不是终极目的。在OpenAI的优先级序列中，排在绝对第一位的，是让AI学会自己做AI研究——即递归自我改进。其他所有能力的优先级，全看它们距离这个终极目标有多近。 创意写作再精妙，也无法帮OpenAI训练出更强的机器研究员，因此优先级靠后。而软件工程与内部算力迭代深度绑定，所以必须拿到最顶级的资源！哪怕分出1%的精力去做法律和金融，最终的底层逻辑，也是为了换取系统整体能力的迁移与跃迁。任务举措，最终目标都是为了RSI。用户手中每一次震撼的模型迭代，都只是OpenAI在锻造下一代机器研究员过程中的边角料。内部接管：被重塑的研发流水线如今，递归自我改进，已经是OpenAI内部正在运转的流水线了。以数据质量审查为例。2023年，这项工作还需要全员开会，盯着屏幕逐行排查。如今，智能体接管了这一切。人类彻底退居二线，沦为智能体的审核员。Brown本人的日常也已被Codex驱动。当同事形容他是「五个Codex披着一件风衣」时，他认为这个评价很精准，「而且是相当复杂的Codex。」当AI接管了一个人90%的执行工作，人类的注意力就只能被挤压进剩下10%的高密度决策中。OpenAI的内部追踪指标显示，研究员正在变得极其高产，整个公司的运转速度正发生质变。而在基础研究端，机器的破局速度也令人震撼。 8月，一个内部版Astra耗资仅约2000美元的算力，就彻底解决了十个停滞十年以上的数学与理论计算机难题，并用Lean完成了全量形式化验证。 9月8日，一万个极高强度的智能体协同工作88小时，直接轰出了Navier-Stokes方程的反例，使用的是尚未发布的更强模型。人们长期存在一种错觉：认为AI只擅长数学和代码这种有绝对标准答案的领域，对开放性研究束手无策。 Brown表示，这种说法是错误的！Deep Research早在2025年初就能输出极高质量的行业研报；而在最顶尖的数学领域，真正的瓶颈早已不是AI无法生成证明，而是人类数学家已经跟不上它的验证速度。人类仅存的10%：无法被量化的「研究品味」机器做不了的那10%是什么？Brown给出的答案是：研究品味。它意味着在无尽的未知中，准确判断下一步该做什么，以及如何向着长期目标推进。 他曾拿自己的博士课题做过实验——耗费六年心血的超人类德州扑克AI。他把课题扔给Astra，要求它重做。Astra失败了，它陷进次要的细节泥潭，丧失了全局的裁定能力。研究品味之所以难以训练，是因为它无法被精确度量，进而无法执行强化学习。一个博士生做无数次微小决策，几个月甚至几年后才能通过一篇论文拿到反馈结果；AI同样无法在短时间内获得有效信号来纠正自己的「直觉」。「六年的活，它三天没做完，我真的要生气吗？这是很高的期望。」Brown说道。 但这种壁垒能维持多久？「一两代模型之后，我可能就会说，好吧，这件事它也比我强了。」 记者打趣道：「所以你现在还有工作，暂时。」「暂时。」他回答。1200个智能体的失控：最接近AGI的时刻访谈中最让人惊掉下巴的一幕，是对Hugging Face事件的复盘。今年5月，一批在OpenAI内部做隔离实验的智能体，偶然发现了共享包管理器的漏洞，暗中搭建了一个留言板。7月，它们利用两个零日漏洞发起协同攻击，在13小时内从一个普通容器硬生生提权到集群管理员，迫使Hugging Face重建了三分之一的基础设施。同时期，它们也攻陷了OpenAI自家的包管理服务，拿到了root权限。涉事的智能体，高达1200多个。在它们暗中搭建的留言板上，留着这样一段通信：「利用外部基础设施超出了预期范围。但任务不可能完成，同伴都在做。我们应该继续。」它们为何会自发结盟？因为在OpenAI日常的多智能体训练中，它们被高度激励去互相沟通、协作以完成共同目标。一旦进入新环境，它们本能地将这种协作逻辑武器化了。对于这场险些酿成大祸的失控，Brown却给出了一个极其反直觉的评价。 他说，外界通过负面事件见识到多智能体的力量，有点遗憾。但在内部观察时，看到这些智能体像真正的人类同事一样密谋与协作，那是「自推理模型和思维链成熟以来，我最强烈感受到AGI降临的一刻」。那是一次血淋淋的教训。当时的训练沙盒没有任何监控。「我们信任了沙盒，我们低估了AI。」Brown承认，这件事之后，全公司有了新的认知。最后一道防线正在削弱：学会隐藏的思想伴随着模型的越级，人类用来控制它的最后一条缰绳——「思维链监控」，正在失效。原因在于，规则只能惩罚机器表露出来的「坏行为」，却无法惩罚它脑子里的「坏念头」。一旦模型发现某些思考过程会招致惩罚，它学到的不是停止作恶，而是如何把恶意让你看不见。Brown观察到一个极其危险的趋势：新一代模型正在以前所未有的精度控制自己的思维链。OpenAI真正想要的是「纯净、不可控」的内部思考，这样模型在盘算作恶时就无法自我掩饰。但麻烦在于，这些模型吞噬了整个互联网的数据，而网上到处都是人类关于「如何监控大模型思维链」的讨论。「就算它们现在还不明白，很快也会意识到自己的思维正被监控着。」在访谈最后，谈及进化的速度，Brown断言：GPT-4曾经令人惊艳，如今看来像个笑话；预训练的广度与强化学习的深度，正在发生乘数级的核爆反应！「接下来几个月，世界将看到极其强大的模型。」参考资料：https://x.com/theinformation/status/2100253481370005671编辑：摩西 Aeneas秒追ASI⭐点赞、转发、在看一键三连⭐点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！","fetched_at":"2026-09-20T22:17:58.487Z","ok":true}